Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.91,0:15:08.67,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.22,0:15:11.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.01,0:15:14.69,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好靈活的身手！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.95,0:15:17.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,畢竟是Wing做的小鳥呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.38,0:15:19.03,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,討厭 欸嘿嘿嘿...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.19,0:15:20.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不是臉紅的時候啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.09,0:15:22.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.23,0:15:23.56,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.44,0:15:33.24,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,雙色合一！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.65,0:15:34.61,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,白色！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.65,0:15:34.61,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}White！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.30,0:15:37.29,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,藍色！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.30,0:15:37.29,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Blue！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.19,0:15:44.01,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,溫度的力量 給你降降溫！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.22,0:15:47.54,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.07,0:15:51.07,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,融合調色盤還有那種功能嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.31,0:15:52.53,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,花樣還多著呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.95,0:15:54.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,現在行了... 呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.63,0:15:56.49,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,拉拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.64,0:15:57.65,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,成了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.87,0:15:59.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,趁機接著打！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.45,0:16:02.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.19,0:16:06.46,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂... 暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.62,0:16:07.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.98,0:16:10.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,明明都凍住了 為什麼還能飛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.69,0:16:14.11,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是上升氣流
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.62,0:16:19.34,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴獸乘著向天空而上的氣流
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.76,0:16:22.80,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊 Wing也一樣能夠辦到吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.85,0:16:25.15,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我試試看！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.66,0:16:26.74,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.44,0:16:33.69,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.21,0:16:34.93,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.68,0:16:47.53,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Butterfly 對著雲使用剛才的降溫能力！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.31,0:16:50.46,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,不是對著亂暴獸 而是對著雲？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.03,0:16:54.75,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,溫度的力量 給你降降溫！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.71,0:17:06.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂！暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.48,0:17:08.50,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,冰... 冰塊？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.77,0:17:10.26,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼一回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.68,0:17:15.45,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,雲本來就是很小的水滴或者冰晶集合而成的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.10,0:17:20.83,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,用降溫的能力來冷卻雲 讓冰晶變大
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.27,0:17:24.27,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,融合調色盤還能實現這種效果啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.67,0:17:26.52,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,花樣還多著呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.47,0:17:29.60,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,整什麼花活...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.77,0:17:34.32,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你那種花樣 看我用大力來破 亂暴獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.73,0:17:37.46,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.71,0:17:45.49,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,這也太猛了...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.45,0:17:50.26,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才亂暴獸的飛行 是乘著上升氣流...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.16,0:17:53.18,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,對了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.65,0:17:54.45,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.66,0:17:55.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,休想！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.71,0:17:58.68,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,中計了呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.92,0:18:03.96,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,強風只要撞上山 就會產生強烈的上升氣流！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.08,0:18:08.15,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.33,0:18:09.43,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.70,0:18:13.09,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不... 不如說一對一來得好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.37,0:18:14.53,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.71,0:18:15.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.61,0:18:20.74,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.69,0:18:27.97,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,只靠著Precure的力量 是無法飛到這麼高的...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.37,0:18:32.02,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有白費啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.55,0:18:34.85,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.01,0:18:36.13,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.14,0:18:39.47,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.15,0:18:43.28,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,拉拉...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.62,0:18:47.77,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.20,0:18:50.12,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Butterfly
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.31,0:18:51.81,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,要飛揚起來了 Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.41,0:18:53.53,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.97,0:18:57.01,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,全色合一！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.30,0:18:58.64,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,融合調色盤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.30,0:18:58.64,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Mix Palette！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.08,0:18:59.92,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,紅色！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.08,0:18:59.92,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Red！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.78,0:19:02.94,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,黃色！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.78,0:19:02.94,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Yellow！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.38,0:19:05.57,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,藍色！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.38,0:19:05.57,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Blue！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.08,0:19:08.35,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,白色！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.08,0:19:08.35,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}White！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.93,0:19:15.81,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,攪拌攪拌
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.98,0:19:17.49,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,色彩填充！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.98,0:19:17.49,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Colour Charge！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.09,0:19:41.38,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,光美·絢爛彩虹衝擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.09,0:19:41.38,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Precure Titanic Rainbow Attack！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.10,0:19:48.45,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然開朗
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.10,0:19:48.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然開朗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.92,0:19:54.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,魔鏡平板！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.92,0:19:54.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Mirrorpad！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.42,0:20:02.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.84,0:20:09.27,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嘁！搞什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.44,0:20:12.81,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你們能得意的日子也就剩今天了 我可是說真的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.71,0:20:17.41,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼... 似乎到了使用那個的時候了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.90,0:20:19.44,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,虛蜢蜢！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.58,0:20:27.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7}{\fs50}《有治療效果的花草世界》《礦石詳解》《解惑宇宙天梯圖鑑》《觀星天文學》
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.97,0:20:29.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按照阿翼弟弟的委託 我帶來了各種不同內容的書
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.85,0:20:31.22,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.96,0:20:35.64,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然 我現在還沒有大伙那樣具體的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.24,0:20:40.00,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我想先學習一下各種不同的學問
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.07,0:20:43.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 我覺得很不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.18,0:20:48.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有一樣東西 希望你能夠收下...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.91,0:20:50.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.11,0:20:52.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.28,0:20:53.05,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.21,0:20:54.48,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,真的可以嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.01,0:21:01.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個魔鏡平板能夠協助你\N\N將求知心連接起來 擴展開來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.94,0:21:06.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼弟弟使用的話 就能夠成為大家強有力的後盾
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.45,0:21:08.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.63,0:21:10.59,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.26,0:21:12.68,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.02,0:21:16.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.38,0:21:18.54,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼我們吃晚餐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.81,0:21:22.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,今天吃夏季蔬菜多多的自家咖哩！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.51,0:21:23.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,咖哩！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.57,0:21:24.77,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,卡裡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.99,0:21:29.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,白天吃了油咖哩 現在口味都是咖哩的口味了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.69,0:21:32.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 我也知道一點咖哩的知識哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.44,0:21:34.63,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.94,0:21:39.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,咖哩飯不是咖辣飯 甜口的咖哩也很好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.94,0:21:39.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}請回顧第8集
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.21,0:21:42.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈... 是啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.35,0:21:44.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我喜歡吃中辣的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.84,0:21:47.76,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,甜口和中辣 都做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.19,0:21:50.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我都要吃！全都要吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.87,0:21:53.92,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,把... 把我那份給留下啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.95,0:21:59.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊嗚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.67,0:22:09.07,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Blossom！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.67,0:22:09.07,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1075,970)}綻放愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.67,0:22:12.80,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,和我一起 讓心之花綻放吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.37,0:23:49.08,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天大地那邊傳來了新的情報？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.25,0:23:53.48,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,莉虹莓隊員來電說 有颯拉拉隊長的目擊情報
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.66,0:23:54.93,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.14,0:23:57.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,隊長 我相信你不會出事的！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.07,0:24:00.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.07,0:24:00.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海闊天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.58,0:24:03.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,虛蜢達 最後的秘策！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.27,0:01:19.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（衝上藍天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.48,0:01:25.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 超越雲巔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.28,0:01:30.62,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飛吧！向著海闊天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.62,0:01:38.33,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空萬里 美麗藍天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.53,0:01:43.45,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨後初霽天空稜鏡折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.75,0:01:47.71,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天的景色預告著有好事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.71,0:01:49.22,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（藍天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.22,0:01:53.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要確認一下 便伸直了雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.10,0:01:58.10,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名為希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.19,0:02:00.06,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速緊握！緊緊握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.19,0:02:04.65,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,戰勝絕望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.03,0:02:08.60,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我們能堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.60,0:02:11.99,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦乾眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.64,0:02:11.99,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已經做好準備了嗎）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.99,0:02:14.04,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飛躍而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.39,0:02:14.04,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(讓我們張開勇氣之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.37,0:02:19.75,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 朝氣蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.96,0:02:24.42,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把煩躁化為光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.62,0:02:29.72,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未來的圖景 充滿著可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.89,0:02:34.47,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,與在同一片藍天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.85,0:02:37.27,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起喚起通向明日的奇蹟！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.39,0:02:45.27,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海闊天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.12,0:22:29.79,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了!! 晴空萬里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.77,0:22:34.36,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是能實現夢想與心願的蔚藍
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.52,0:22:37.11,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,打開心中的麥克風
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.11,0:22:38.94,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,輕輕哼唱起！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.94,0:22:41.32,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望的旋律♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.78,0:22:44.24,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}今天心情愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.24,0:22:46.20,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}如果能與你分享
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.20,0:22:48.87,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就能打開心靈+門扉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.95,0:22:51.66,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}稍等片刻！我已經激動到勢不可擋!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.66,0:22:53.33,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}笑容也在合唱！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.46,0:22:56.00,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧☆我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.15,0:23:02.57,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}還是那條街 {\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}就像平日裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.28,0:23:08.39,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在那裡 這便是奇蹟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.39,0:23:10.74,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的寶貝！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.45,0:23:15.12,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都過來！傳開這韻律
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.12,0:23:19.38,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,手牽起手 心連起心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.38,0:23:25.45,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,用溫暖的關懷 培育出的勇氣 是無窮無窮的∞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.55,0:23:29.72,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,積極的圖示是標記
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.72,0:23:33.89,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,想要更了解！這海闊天空的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.89,0:23:37.59,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們展開翅膀 飛向藍天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.59,0:23:38.98,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,連接起人與人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.98,0:23:41.69,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure 笑容的圓環！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
